# Fixtures are regenerated inside the image and verified against the manifest,
# so shipping ~7 MB of host-generated JSON would be both wasteful and a way to
# accidentally skip the determinism check. The manifest itself must survive the
# exclusion — it is the expected-hash list the build verifies against.
fixtures/*.json
!fixtures/manifest.json

# Regenerated by `pnpm codegen` during the build. The composed supergraph is
# mounted into the router container instead.
generated/

node_modules/
README.md
router.yaml
router.docker.yaml
